# Partner co-branded URLs — getfinscan.com/{slug} → /?ref={slug}
# Add one line per partner. Keep entries lowercase and matching the slug used in partners.json.
#
# How to add a new partner:
#   1) Edit partners.json → add their entry under "partners"
#   2) Add a line below following the same pattern
#   3) git commit + push → Netlify deploys in ~30 seconds
#
# IMPORTANT: keep the explicit list. Do NOT use a catch-all (e.g. /:slug → /?ref=:slug)
# because it would intercept any future first-level path you add (like /pricing).

# Deep links for IG bio / story links (no `#` — Instagram URL-encodes it).
/scan            /?scan                301
/freescan        /?scan                301
/checklist       /?checklist           301

/tiagomelocosta  /?ref=tiagomelocosta  301
/demo            /?ref=demo            301
